      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDcgpn2xAoM",
      "content": "Yeah, so most of the issue yesterday was lack of communication, the movers were, they were good they were efficient and so what happened yesterday I got a call probably 2:00 I'd give, I've been given the time window of, you know, 12:45 to 245. Zach called me at two said, hey, they're gonna probably be there at the back end of that window. Just wanted to give you a heads-up they're running a little behind cool. Great. Appreciate it. He said if they're late we will give you a the discount that you guys have in your, in your paperwork.",
