    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDcgpn2xAoM",
      "content": "So, 2245 comes, I don't hear anything from anybody, so I call and I talked to another gentleman and I did not get his name and and he says, okay, let me check, he said he called Zack, he said he, you know, he put me on hold. He went, he talked to some people said, okay, it's probably gonna be an additional hour.",
