      "content": "So now we're looking at $345, so then he tells me, okay, we're gonna add a, an additional mover to a third, no charge. But we will also continue to give you the discount. So whatever is in your guys' paperwork, I think it was $5,050 for the first thirty minutes and then $25 after or something like that. So he says, if they're, if it's gonna be any later than that I will reach out I will let you know, okay great $345 comes and goes. I don't hear from anybody so I call again and then I believe I speak to Arden and I'm gonna be completely honest, she was not any help she.",
